(5613841, 814109, 39429, '<td valign="top">Beautiful model, lighting and tie in to the challenge.  I''m not crazy about the NI effect - but may be wrong and she might really have that dewy, soft, creamy skin.  If so, I want her secret.  ;-)</td>', 'Beautiful model, lighting and tie in to the challenge.  I''m not crazy about the NI effect - but may be wrong and she might really have that dewy, soft, creamy skin.  If so, I want her secret.  ;-)', '2009-08-17 01:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5613843, 814216, 39429, '<td valign="top">I love this shot and concept.  Well done.</td>', 'I love this shot and concept.  Well done.', '2009-08-17 01:40:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5613849, 814139, 39429, '<td valign="top">This concept is terrific and the image works.</td>', 'This concept is terrific and the image works.', '2009-08-17 01:44:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5613853, 814463, 39429, '<td valign="top">A unique concept.  I don''t completely get it, but still like it.  It has a pull at me.</td>', 'A unique concept.  I don''t completely get it, but still like it.  It has a pull at me.', '2009-08-17 01:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5613854, 814132, 39429, '<td valign="top">Nice care shot, and terrific plate.  I am a sucker for ponies.</td>', 'Nice care shot, and terrific plate.  I am a sucker for ponies.', '2009-08-17 01:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5613859, 814038, 39429, '<td valign="top">Very intersting composition.  The PP was well done, as I''m assuming the red and yellow were done in PP.  It works well.</td>', 'Very intersting composition.  The PP was well done, as I''m assuming the red and yellow were done in PP.  It works well.', '2009-08-17 01:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5613861, 814278, 39429, '<td valign="top">While this image has ribbons in it, they are not the DPC ribbons.  More importantly, the image is rather flate and not very interesting.</td>', 'While this image has ribbons in it, they are not the DPC ribbons.  More importantly, the image is rather flate and not very interesting.', '2009-08-17 01:48:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5613865, 814147, 101117, '<td valign="top">I think focus or motion blur has let you down a bit here. While the eyes that are obviously the focal point do seem sharp, the rest of the face isn''t.<br/> <br/>There are also some pretty harsh areas of lighting on the skin, in particular around the nose and left eye (right side of the shot).</td>', 'I think focus or motion blur has let you down a bit here. While the eyes that are obviously the focal point do seem sharp, the rest of the face isn''t. There are also some pretty harsh areas of lighting on the skin, in particular around the nose and left eye (right side of the shot).', '2009-08-17 01:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5613869, 814038, 63812, '<td valign="top">beautiful blue image...love the colours and shadows</td>', 'beautiful blue image...love the colours and shadows', '2009-08-17 01:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5613874, 814244, 101117, '<td valign="top">I kinda sorta see where you are going here, but it''s s stretch.<br/> <br/>I see a yellow / orange curtain, which I tie loosely to ''dreaming'' and ''yellow'', still that''s only because I was trying to find the connection.<br/> <br/>As for the shot, there''s no real focal point, and not really great focus at all.</td>', 'I kinda sorta see where you are going here, but it''s s stretch. I see a yellow / orange curtain, which I tie loosely to ''dreaming'' and ''yellow'', still that''s only because I was trying to find the connection. As for the shot, there''s no real focal point, and not really great focus at all.', '2009-08-17 01:51:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5613879, 814216, 63812, '<td valign="top">nice image, smart idea, well composed . Good luck 8</td>', 'nice image, smart idea, well composed . Good luck 8', '2009-08-17 01:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5613882, 814466, 39429, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t feel like a serious attempt at an interesting image.  I do commend you oun using the DPC red, yellow and blue ribbons.</td>', 'This doesn''t feel like a serious attempt at an interesting image.  I do commend you oun using the DPC red, yellow and blue ribbons.', '2009-08-17 01:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5613883, 814260, 101117, '<td valign="top">This is a nice fun shot. I like the fact that you have red, yellow and blue in there. I imagine you''re going to get a lot of DMNC because they aren''t the DPC ribbons, but I like it and think it meets the challenge nicely.<br/> <br/>Not so keen on the B&amp;W areas of the shot, particularly the background, I think the whole thing would have been nicer in colour. 7 from me.</td>', 'This is a nice fun shot. I like the fact that you have red, yellow and blue in there. I imagine you''re going to get a lot of DMNC because they aren''t the DPC ribbons, but I like it and think it meets the challenge nicely. Not so keen on the B&W areas of the shot, particularly the background, I think the whole thing would have been nicer in colour. 7 from me.', '2009-08-17 01:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5613884, 814241, 39429, '<td valign="top">The challenge requires the red, yellow or blue DPC reibbon.</td>', 'The challenge requires the red, yellow or blue DPC reibbon.', '2009-08-17 01:54:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5613885, 814444, 39429, '<td valign="top">No thanks.  Interesting shot, but the challenge requires the red, yellow or blue DPC reibbon.</td>', 'No thanks.  Interesting shot, but the challenge requires the red, yellow or blue DPC reibbon.', '2009-08-17 01:54:14.000000', NULL, 1),
