(5613889, 814241, 63812, '<td valign="top">hahaha! are you searching the brown?</td>', 'hahaha! are you searching the brown?', '2009-08-17 01:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5613893, 814032, 101117, '<td valign="top">Heh, I like it, great idea! Good colours and lighting, perhaps just a touch harsh, but only a touch.<br/> <br/>Love the worn out browns, great touch! 8 from me.</td>', 'Heh, I like it, great idea! Good colours and lighting, perhaps just a touch harsh, but only a touch. Love the worn out browns, great touch! 8 from me.', '2009-08-17 01:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5613895, 814342, 63812, '<td valign="top">nice job!</td>', 'nice job!', '2009-08-17 01:57:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5613897, 814407, 101117, '<td valign="top">There just had to be a Woody in here somewhere! Really nice shot actually, I like the play on the theme and the whole setup is clever and amusing. 8.</td>', 'There just had to be a Woody in here somewhere! Really nice shot actually, I like the play on the theme and the whole setup is clever and amusing. 8.', '2009-08-17 01:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5613899, 814237, 101117, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of the M&amp;M guys, especially with the bored expression you''ve given him. Nice setup and well lit. Just feels a touch cut off at the top for me. 7.</td>', 'Reminds me of the M&M guys, especially with the bored expression you''ve given him. Nice setup and well lit. Just feels a touch cut off at the top for me. 7.', '2009-08-17 02:00:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5613902, 814363, 101117, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, nice that it''s a bit different from the others I''ve seen so far, but I don''t think you''ve done the best job of capturing it (excuse the pun).<br/> <br/>Feels to me like you''ve done a whole bunch of sharpening to try and remove the motion blur and it''s resulted in a bit of an unusual look to the shot.</td>', 'Interesting shot, nice that it''s a bit different from the others I''ve seen so far, but I don''t think you''ve done the best job of capturing it (excuse the pun). Feels to me like you''ve done a whole bunch of sharpening to try and remove the motion blur and it''s resulted in a bit of an unusual look to the shot.', '2009-08-17 02:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5613906, 814048, 101117, '<td valign="top">Great effect, would like to see how you put this one together. Nice clean shot, to the point and manages to be interesting in a challenge which makes it difficult to be original! Good job, 9 from me.</td>', 'Great effect, would like to see how you put this one together. Nice clean shot, to the point and manages to be interesting in a challenge which makes it difficult to be original! Good job, 9 from me.', '2009-08-17 02:05:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5613908, 813236, 63812, '<td valign="top">excellent picture!  I think this might be a winner.</td>', 'excellent picture!  I think this might be a winner.', '2009-08-17 02:06:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5613911, 814415, 101117, '<td valign="top">Took me a while to take this one in properly and see what was going on. I didn''t instantly see the burst balloon pinned to the ribbon, I thought the idea was that it had burst in the shape of the ribbon (not that it really matters, but I figured I would mention it anyway).<br/> <br/>Nice concept, don''t think the bland brown background helps particularly, and the balloons all look kinda deflated and  limp.</td>', 'Took me a while to take this one in properly and see what was going on. I didn''t instantly see the burst balloon pinned to the ribbon, I thought the idea was that it had burst in the shape of the ribbon (not that it really matters, but I figured I would mention it anyway). Nice concept, don''t think the bland brown background helps particularly, and the balloons all look kinda deflated and  limp.', '2009-08-17 02:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5613913, 814139, 63812, '<td valign="top">very good idea. I love it!</td>', 'very good idea. I love it!', '2009-08-17 02:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5613916, 814364, 63812, '<td valign="top">lovely image</td>', 'lovely image', '2009-08-17 02:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5613917, 814313, 101117, '<td valign="top">There had to be at least one! Nice execution, and good clear focus. The ribbons didn''t seem to come out particularly well in the drops though, I can see the read ones clearly enough, but the blue ones are a bit squashed into the bottom.<br/> <br/>I''m guessing the whole setup is sitting on a blue ribbon as well, but that doesn''t come across straight away.</td>', 'There had to be at least one! Nice execution, and good clear focus. The ribbons didn''t seem to come out particularly well in the drops though, I can see the read ones clearly enough, but the blue ones are a bit squashed into the bottom. I''m guessing the whole setup is sitting on a blue ribbon as well, but that doesn''t come across straight away.', '2009-08-17 02:11:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5613918, 814335, 101117, '<td valign="top">Good clear shot. Nothing particularly wrong with this, but nothing particularly outstanding either.<br/> <br/>Looks to me like you''ve actually cut the denim through to the blue, rather than stuck the blue on top of the denim, if that''s the case I''m wondering where exactly that ribbon will sit when you''re wearing them!</td>', 'Good clear shot. Nothing particularly wrong with this, but nothing particularly outstanding either. Looks to me like you''ve actually cut the denim through to the blue, rather than stuck the blue on top of the denim, if that''s the case I''m wondering where exactly that ribbon will sit when you''re wearing them!', '2009-08-17 02:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5613921, 814000, 101117, '<td valign="top">If you hadn''t told me with the title, it may have taken me a while to figure out exactly what this is!<br/> <br/>Nice idea, and I like the black on yellow. Those eggs seem almost luminous in appearance! Don''t know that the stripy background helps at all though.</td>', 'If you hadn''t told me with the title, it may have taken me a while to figure out exactly what this is! Nice idea, and I like the black on yellow. Those eggs seem almost luminous in appearance! Don''t know that the stripy background helps at all though.', '2009-08-17 02:15:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5613922, 814364, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of the horses, but the frame and ribbon seem out of focus. Also, I think it would have helped if you had even amounts of space around the outside of the frame (or none at all).</td>', 'Nice shot of the horses, but the frame and ribbon seem out of focus. Also, I think it would have helped if you had even amounts of space around the outside of the frame (or none at all).', '2009-08-17 02:17:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5613925, 814000, 63812, '<td valign="top">nice job with this!</td>', 'nice job with this!', '2009-08-17 02:18:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5613927, 814300, 101117, '<td valign="top">Like it, it''s a good comparison! Lighting feels a touch harsh, especially on the tin and the dogs fur and the colours are a touch washed out, both probably as a result of the on camera flash.</td>', 'Like it, it''s a good comparison! Lighting feels a touch harsh, especially on the tin and the dogs fur and the colours are a touch washed out, both probably as a result of the on camera flash.', '2009-08-17 02:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5613930, 814410, 101117, '<td valign="top">Great idea, I''m wondering how you put this one together! Not particularly keen on the angle you''ve taken it from though, it has me tilting my head left and right trying to see it properly. 7.</td>', 'Great idea, I''m wondering how you put this one together! Not particularly keen on the angle you''ve taken it from though, it has me tilting my head left and right trying to see it properly. 7.', '2009-08-17 02:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5613932, 814247, 63812, '<td valign="top">Would work better with other kind of "ribbon". It''s a very nice portrait, though.</td>', 'Would work better with other kind of "ribbon". It''s a very nice portrait, though.', '2009-08-17 02:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5613948, 814268, 63812, '<td valign="top">I recognize the style, simple but effective. Just a ribbon.<br/>Certainly bring back one more ;-)</td>', 'I recognize the style, simple but effective. Just a ribbon.Certainly bring back one more ;-)', '2009-08-17 02:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5613951, 814076, 63812, '<td valign="top">very nice.  Good lights and effect</td>', 'very nice.  Good lights and effect', '2009-08-17 02:52:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5613953, 814444, 101117, '<td valign="top">So what does your photo have to communicate to win this then?<br/> <br/>I get that this is a DPC style ribbon, though not exactly one of the blue, red or yellow the challenge was asking for. Still, I like the humour here, and it''s not too far off topic so I''ll give it a 6.</td>', 'So what does your photo have to communicate to win this then? I get that this is a DPC style ribbon, though not exactly one of the blue, red or yellow the challenge was asking for. Still, I like the humour here, and it''s not too far off topic so I''ll give it a 6.', '2009-08-17 02:55:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5613954, 814313, 99506, '<td valign="top">The problem is that water drops and refracted images are pretty unoriginal now</td>', 'The problem is that water drops and refracted images are pretty unoriginal now', '2009-08-17 02:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5613962, 814282, 101117, '<td valign="top">Ahh water drops, this challenge was a dead certainty to have a few. Nice colours here, blue and yellow always go well together. Good focus on the ribbon in the drop as well.<br/> <br/>Everything in this shot is done correctly, positioning, focus, lighting etc, but I''m only going to give this a 6 because of the fact that it''s a vastly overdone theme here.</td>', 'Ahh water drops, this challenge was a dead certainty to have a few. Nice colours here, blue and yellow always go well together. Good focus on the ribbon in the drop as well. Everything in this shot is done correctly, positioning, focus, lighting etc, but I''m only going to give this a 6 because of the fact that it''s a vastly overdone theme here.', '2009-08-17 03:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5613964, 814342, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, though I think it would have been nicer to maintain some of the skin tones rather than go for the B&amp;W. The ribbon is well positioned in the eye, but the large white area "behind" it in the reflection detracts from it.</td>', 'Nice shot, though I think it would have been nicer to maintain some of the skin tones rather than go for the B&W. The ribbon is well positioned in the eye, but the large white area "behind" it in the reflection detracts from it.', '2009-08-17 03:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5613965, 814287, 99506, '<td valign="top">you saw a green ribbon? lol</td>', 'you saw a green ribbon? lol', '2009-08-17 03:03:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5613966, 814312, 101117, '<td valign="top">Heh, if you win the challenge you should get one of those for real ;)<br/> <br/>Nice shot, bit more original than most I''ve come across so far, though I think you could have found a catchier title for it.</td>', 'Heh, if you win the challenge you should get one of those for real ;) Nice shot, bit more original than most I''ve come across so far, though I think you could have found a catchier title for it.', '2009-08-17 03:05:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5613967, 814466, 101117, '<td valign="top">Ehh, OK, I think you get the idea across. Unfortunately it doesn''t make for the best shot. I get the idea at humour (I think), but just sounds more like an angry rebellion to me.</td>', 'Ehh, OK, I think you get the idea across. Unfortunately it doesn''t make for the best shot. I get the idea at humour (I think), but just sounds more like an angry rebellion to me.', '2009-08-17 03:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5613968, 814200, 101117, '<td valign="top">Indeed it is! And we may spend large amounts of time chasing it without success.<br/> <br/>As for the shot, fun concept, not particularly outstanding, but clear and definitely gets the message across.</td>', 'Indeed it is! And we may spend large amounts of time chasing it without success. As for the shot, fun concept, not particularly outstanding, but clear and definitely gets the message across.', '2009-08-17 03:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5613969, 814466, 99506, '<td valign="top">hmmm that knife look like a pic of a pic to me and I think you are trying to fool me into thinking I''m looking at a table by using a poster of wood as your backdrop but the pic in the foreground is clearly real so good work</td>', 'hmmm that knife look like a pic of a pic to me and I think you are trying to fool me into thinking I''m looking at a table by using a poster of wood as your backdrop but the pic in the foreground is clearly real so good work', '2009-08-17 03:09:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5613970, 814038, 99506, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and good execution but refracted images are becoming a little tired on here sorry</td>', 'Nice idea and good execution but refracted images are becoming a little tired on here sorry', '2009-08-17 03:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5613972, 813481, 99506, '<td valign="top">very clever idea</td>', 'very clever idea', '2009-08-17 03:11:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5613974, 814301, 101117, '<td valign="top">MMmmmmm, pepperoni!<br/> <br/>Fun idea. Not really in focus though, and not the most attractive of shots. Still, the pizza looks nice, hope you enjoyed it!</td>', 'MMmmmmm, pepperoni! Fun idea. Not really in focus though, and not the most attractive of shots. Still, the pizza looks nice, hope you enjoyed it!', '2009-08-17 03:12:07.000000', NULL, 1),
