(5614038, 814289, 101117, '<td valign="top">That''s quite a collection you''ve got there!<br/> <br/>There''s a couple of things I don''t like here. Firstly there''s a strange red tint to the whole image. Second is the carpet / rug you have used as the backdrop. It doesn''t add anything at all to the image and is just kinda in the way. Lastly is the angle, it''s not quite straight on, but it''s not really angled, it''s just lingering in that ''in between'' kinda area.</td>', 'That''s quite a collection you''ve got there! There''s a couple of things I don''t like here. Firstly there''s a strange red tint to the whole image. Second is the carpet / rug you have used as the backdrop. It doesn''t add anything at all to the image and is just kinda in the way. Lastly is the angle, it''s not quite straight on, but it''s not really angled, it''s just lingering in that ''in between'' kinda area.', '2009-08-17 05:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5614039, 814278, 101117, '<td valign="top">Heh, I''m sure this isn''t related directly to DPC, but nice find nonetheless!<br/> <br/>Nice contrast of colours here, especially the white against the deep blue sky. The composition is a bit strange, it''s almost centred but at an angle at the same time. Still, nice bright cheery image, good to see one outdoors in this challenge!</td>', 'Heh, I''m sure this isn''t related directly to DPC, but nice find nonetheless! Nice contrast of colours here, especially the white against the deep blue sky. The composition is a bit strange, it''s almost centred but at an angle at the same time. Still, nice bright cheery image, good to see one outdoors in this challenge!', '2009-08-17 05:24:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5614040, 814389, 101117, '<td valign="top">I was fully expecting to see some woodys in this challenge, glad I wasn''t disappointed.<br/> <br/>Not sure what exactly the message you''re trying to convey here, it''s clear they''re going to burn the ribbons, but it''s not entirely clear why, or am I just overthinking this?</td>', 'I was fully expecting to see some woodys in this challenge, glad I wasn''t disappointed. Not sure what exactly the message you''re trying to convey here, it''s clear they''re going to burn the ribbons, but it''s not entirely clear why, or am I just overthinking this?', '2009-08-17 05:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
