(5614626, 814067, 37845, '<td valign="top">The photo is well done, and the ribbons are prominent. My only pet peeve about the photo is that this theme has been done many times before.</td>', 'The photo is well done, and the ribbons are prominent. My only pet peeve about the photo is that this theme has been done many times before.', '2009-08-17 16:59:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5614653, 814466, 37845, '<td valign="top">Not sure about the point of including the printed statement, it turns this into a photo of printouts, rather than a creative photo of the ribbons.</td>', 'Not sure about the point of including the printed statement, it turns this into a photo of printouts, rather than a creative photo of the ribbons.', '2009-08-17 17:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5614657, 814363, 37845, '<td valign="top">When I saw this photo I had to search for the blue ribbon, as it was not very prominent. Overall, I find the image to be very busy, and with a lot of distractions.</td>', 'When I saw this photo I had to search for the blue ribbon, as it was not very prominent. Overall, I find the image to be very busy, and with a lot of distractions.', '2009-08-17 17:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5614660, 814260, 37845, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. I like the selective desaturation here as it draws attention to the ribbons. However, I dont feel that it does a great job of showcasing the DPC ribbons, even indirectly.</td>', 'Interesting shot. I like the selective desaturation here as it draws attention to the ribbons. However, I dont feel that it does a great job of showcasing the DPC ribbons, even indirectly.', '2009-08-17 17:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5614662, 814241, 37845, '<td valign="top">This photo has nothing to do with ribbons except for the fact that you mentioned them in your phrase/title. Even as a free study image, a rat and a pipe doesnt appeal to me much.</td>', 'This photo has nothing to do with ribbons except for the fact that you mentioned them in your phrase/title. Even as a free study image, a rat and a pipe doesnt appeal to me much.', '2009-08-17 17:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5614668, 814419, 37845, '<td valign="top">Unique and creative take on the challenge. I think the people could have been placed a little differently, as it was difficult to make out the ribbon at first. Not a big fan of the background either, photographing this on black cloth may improve it IMO.</td>', 'Unique and creative take on the challenge. I think the people could have been placed a little differently, as it was difficult to make out the ribbon at first. Not a big fan of the background either, photographing this on black cloth may improve it IMO.', '2009-08-17 17:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5614669, 814244, 37845, '<td valign="top">Im still trying to figure out that this is?!?  I feel that this doesnt convey the theme of DPC ribbons at all, except for your title.</td>', 'Im still trying to figure out that this is?!?  I feel that this doesnt convey the theme of DPC ribbons at all, except for your title.', '2009-08-17 17:17:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5614670, 814132, 37845, '<td valign="top">Good luck buddy.</td>', 'Good luck buddy.', '2009-08-17 17:17:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5614671, 814465, 37845, '<td valign="top">Unique take on the challenge, and well lit. The face looks mysterious. But, you dont want the blue?  :)</td>', 'Unique take on the challenge, and well lit. The face looks mysterious. But, you dont want the blue?  :)', '2009-08-17 17:18:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5614672, 814076, 37845, '<td valign="top">I am assuming that you flashed this three times to get the different glasses in place. The positioning is really good, and I think the use of the glasses is unique and creative. 7</td>', 'I am assuming that you flashed this three times to get the different glasses in place. The positioning is really good, and I think the use of the glasses is unique and creative. 7', '2009-08-17 17:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5614673, 814287, 103818, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of legend of zelda. I give it a 7, I''m interested to read how you managed to do this.</td>', 'Reminds me of legend of zelda. I give it a 7, I''m interested to read how you managed to do this.', '2009-08-17 17:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5614675, 814216, 37845, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. The technicals are perfect; the lighting is good and provides a lot of shine from the brass. This made me think though, having <u>[Update]</u> at each hour until there is a blue at midnight would work as well.</td>', 'Interesting shot. The technicals are perfect; the lighting is good and provides a lot of shine from the brass. This made me think though, having [Update] at each hour until there is a blue at midnight would work as well.', '2009-08-17 17:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5614678, 814394, 37845, '<td valign="top">I hope you dont get a brown in this challenge. I like the creativity in the shot, using the brown in camera, and blue on the background. Im not crazy about the wooden desk though. 6</td>', 'I hope you dont get a brown in this challenge. I like the creativity in the shot, using the brown in camera, and blue on the background. Im not crazy about the wooden desk though. 6', '2009-08-17 17:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5614679, 814237, 37845, '<td valign="top">Well photographed, and with good colours. I can see a bit of a white box underneath the ribbon guy against the border though, but then again, my monitor is set to really bright, so not everyone will see that.</td>', 'Well photographed, and with good colours. I can see a bit of a white box underneath the ribbon guy against the border though, but then again, my monitor is set to really bright, so not everyone will see that.', '2009-08-17 17:23:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5614681, 814415, 37845, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, and definitly unique.</td>', 'Interesting shot, and definitly unique.', '2009-08-17 17:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5614684, 814364, 37845, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of the horses. I know that the frame was integral to the theme you were going after, but it doesn''t help the photo IMO. 5</td>', 'Nice shot of the horses. I know that the frame was integral to the theme you were going after, but it doesn''t help the photo IMO. 5', '2009-08-17 17:29:48.000000', NULL, 1),
