(5614689, 814469, 37845, '<td valign="top">To be honest, I''m not crazy about this photo. The ribbons, glasses, and camera just seem to be randomly placed objects to me.</td>', 'To be honest, I''m not crazy about this photo. The ribbons, glasses, and camera just seem to be randomly placed objects to me.', '2009-08-17 17:32:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5614692, 814335, 37845, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept. The subject (jeans with a hole in them) doesnt do much for me though, this would have been better if the jeans were being worn by someone. 5</td>', 'Interesting concept. The subject (jeans with a hole in them) doesnt do much for me though, this would have been better if the jeans were being worn by someone. 5', '2009-08-17 17:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
