(5614766, 814342, 37845, '<td valign="top">Really nicely processed, the focus on the left eye is good, and I like the high key skin. Not sure about the out of focus right eye though, I may prefer this in a tighter crop showing just the one eye. Either way, great photo. 8</td>', 'Really nicely processed, the focus on the left eye is good, and I like the high key skin. Not sure about the out of focus right eye though, I may prefer this in a tighter crop showing just the one eye. Either way, great photo. 8', '2009-08-17 19:09:10.000000', NULL, 1),
