(5617971, 814038, 101117, '<td valign="top">A classic DPC shot. I like the fact you have one colour in each drop though, certainly makes it stand out from your run of the mill water drop shots.</td>', 'A classic DPC shot. I like the fact you have one colour in each drop though, certainly makes it stand out from your run of the mill water drop shots.', '2009-08-20 06:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5617972, 814139, 101117, '<td valign="top">Funny, I was thinking of doing something on sleeping as well, couldn''t think of a way to present it though, which you have pulled off successfully.<br/> <br/>Good creative idea and nice presentation. I almost always mark shots down for partial desaturation, but I think this is actually one of the rare examples of it that actually works, well done!</td>', 'Funny, I was thinking of doing something on sleeping as well, couldn''t think of a way to present it though, which you have pulled off successfully. Good creative idea and nice presentation. I almost always mark shots down for partial desaturation, but I think this is actually one of the rare examples of it that actually works, well done!', '2009-08-20 06:29:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5617973, 814323, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. Don''t know if the fully green background is the right choice though, unless you''re going with a Christmas theme with the red and green!<br/> <br/>The colours seem just a touch flat, again, it might be the green, or just something that could have been sorted out in PP.</td>', 'Nice idea. Don''t know if the fully green background is the right choice though, unless you''re going with a Christmas theme with the red and green! The colours seem just a touch flat, again, it might be the green, or just something that could have been sorted out in PP.', '2009-08-20 06:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5617975, 813481, 101117, '<td valign="top">He may have a point, I''ve found the shots I try to ribbon with score lower than the ones I just take for fun!<br/> <br/>I''m not sure if you meant this, but to me the crackers look like a little man lying on his side holding the banner!</td>', 'He may have a point, I''ve found the shots I try to ribbon with score lower than the ones I just take for fun! I''m not sure if you meant this, but to me the crackers look like a little man lying on his side holding the banner!', '2009-08-20 06:35:02.000000', NULL, 1),
