(5619771, 814038, 83313, '<td valign="top">For some reason, overdone cliche shots are ok with me in this challenge.</td>', 'For some reason, overdone cliche shots are ok with me in this challenge.', '2009-08-21 22:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5619774, 814241, 83313, '<td valign="top">Yea, probably not for this shot, anyway. Some extra pointage for the humor and cajones in entering a shot without a ribbon in it.</td>', 'Yea, probably not for this shot, anyway. Some extra pointage for the humor and cajones in entering a shot without a ribbon in it.', '2009-08-21 22:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5619778, 814139, 83313, '<td valign="top">That puts you to sleep?! Very creative!</td>', 'That puts you to sleep?! Very creative!', '2009-08-21 22:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5619780, 814301, 83313, '<td valign="top">I hope you are actually on your own quest for the brown with this entry. If that''s not the case, then I apologize.</td>', 'I hope you are actually on your own quest for the brown with this entry. If that''s not the case, then I apologize.', '2009-08-21 22:29:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5619875, 814278, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice catch!</td>', 'Nice catch!', '2009-08-22 02:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5619940, 814472, 101117, '<td valign="top">Colourful, in focus, but doesn''t particularly jump out at you.<br/> <br/> I don''t think you''ve done anything wrong in the actual execution of the shot, it''s just that the subject matter isn''t particularly outstanding.</td>', 'Colourful, in focus, but doesn''t particularly jump out at you.  I don''t think you''ve done anything wrong in the actual execution of the shot, it''s just that the subject matter isn''t particularly outstanding.', '2009-08-22 06:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5619941, 814461, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice take on the theme. Took me a while to realise that lenses were the bet in this scenario but that could just be me.</td>', 'Nice take on the theme. Took me a while to realise that lenses were the bet in this scenario but that could just be me.', '2009-08-22 06:41:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5619942, 814469, 101117, '<td valign="top">This whole thing feels a bit claustrophobic to me and I don''t see the connection of the glasses with the camera and ribbons, unless of course it is to signify the photographer him/herself.<br/> <br/>There''s also a very harsh light on the whole subject, which has left it a touch flat as well.</td>', 'This whole thing feels a bit claustrophobic to me and I don''t see the connection of the glasses with the camera and ribbons, unless of course it is to signify the photographer him/herself. There''s also a very harsh light on the whole subject, which has left it a touch flat as well.', '2009-08-22 06:43:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5619943, 814465, 101117, '<td valign="top">Can you tell who that red is  going to then?<br/> <br/>I like the way the light seems to be emanating from the sphere itself, yet there is no obvious light source. It doesn''t completely appear as though the ribbon is ''inside'' the glass though (which obviously it isn''t), but I imagine that would have been pretty tricky to accomplish.</td>', 'Can you tell who that red is  going to then? I like the way the light seems to be emanating from the sphere itself, yet there is no obvious light source. It doesn''t completely appear as though the ribbon is ''inside'' the glass though (which obviously it isn''t), but I imagine that would have been pretty tricky to accomplish.', '2009-08-22 06:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5619944, 814266, 101117, '<td valign="top">The light here is very harsh in the foreground falling off very quickly in the background. While it does isolate the subject it also makes it very flat. There''s also some strange item / reflection in the upper left of the frame, which I''m guessing shouldn''t be there.</td>', 'The light here is very harsh in the foreground falling off very quickly in the background. While it does isolate the subject it also makes it very flat. There''s also some strange item / reflection in the upper left of the frame, which I''m guessing shouldn''t be there.', '2009-08-22 06:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5619945, 814318, 101117, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but the lighting is very harsh and it feels a touch overexposed. I think this is a look that would work very well for some other concept of pills (drug use etc.) but it doesn''t feel quite right in this context.</td>', 'I like the idea, but the lighting is very harsh and it feels a touch overexposed. I think this is a look that would work very well for some other concept of pills (drug use etc.) but it doesn''t feel quite right in this context.', '2009-08-22 06:49:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5619946, 814390, 101117, '<td valign="top">While this is a very nice shot in it''s own right, and a great stock image, I have marked it fairly low because I don''t feel it has enough relevance to the challenge. It is a ribbon but it''s not the DPC ribbons. <br/> <br/>Great shot though, love the colours and lighting, great way to fill the frame.</td>', 'While this is a very nice shot in it''s own right, and a great stock image, I have marked it fairly low because I don''t feel it has enough relevance to the challenge. It is a ribbon but it''s not the DPC ribbons.  Great shot though, love the colours and lighting, great way to fill the frame.', '2009-08-22 06:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5619947, 814067, 101117, '<td valign="top">Not sure what''s happened here, but the waterdrops (I''m assuming it''s water) have come out a strange grey colour around the ribbon which isn''t particularly appealing. <br/> <br/>I also think this is a concept which is a touch overdone here, so for me to score it highly you would have to pull it off in either spectacular fashion or some sort of different approach, I''m afraid neither of which you''ve managed here for me.</td>', 'Not sure what''s happened here, but the waterdrops (I''m assuming it''s water) have come out a strange grey colour around the ribbon which isn''t particularly appealing.  I also think this is a concept which is a touch overdone here, so for me to score it highly you would have to pull it off in either spectacular fashion or some sort of different approach, I''m afraid neither of which you''ve managed here for me.', '2009-08-22 06:54:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5619948, 814145, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice enough picture, but not particularly outstanding. Also not strictly a DPC ribbon and while I''m not usually one for dishing out DNMC''s freely, the challenge did specifically state that it should be one of the DPC ones.</td>', 'Nice enough picture, but not particularly outstanding. Also not strictly a DPC ribbon and while I''m not usually one for dishing out DNMC''s freely, the challenge did specifically state that it should be one of the DPC ones.', '2009-08-22 06:56:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5619949, 814103, 101117, '<td valign="top">Don''t we all! <br/> <br/>The shot feels a touch overexposed and the actual colours are a bit off, there''s also seems to be a bit of blur, either down to motion or more likely focus.</td>', 'Don''t we all!  The shot feels a touch overexposed and the actual colours are a bit off, there''s also seems to be a bit of blur, either down to motion or more likely focus.', '2009-08-22 06:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5619950, 813375, 101117, '<td valign="top">You certainly have the lot in here! I like the irony of the DPC clichés with the dead looking flower. The shot itself is fairly unappealing, mostly down to the harsh lighting and flat looking colours, and I''m wondering if you did that intentionally for the irony.</td>', 'You certainly have the lot in here! I like the irony of the DPC clichés with the dead looking flower. The shot itself is fairly unappealing, mostly down to the harsh lighting and flat looking colours, and I''m wondering if you did that intentionally for the irony.', '2009-08-22 07:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5619951, 814247, 101117, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice portrait, great expression and posing. Unfortunately I can''t score it highly because there isn''t a single ribbon in sight, never mind a DPC one (I see the blue but to me that''s a flower)!<br/> <br/>Still, great shot otherwise!</td>', 'This is a really nice portrait, great expression and posing. Unfortunately I can''t score it highly because there isn''t a single ribbon in sight, never mind a DPC one (I see the blue but to me that''s a flower)! Still, great shot otherwise!', '2009-08-22 07:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5619952, 814419, 101117, '<td valign="top">Creative, but not meeting the challenge for me I''m afraid. I might go for it if there was actually a brown ribbon but little gold people..hmm, I don''t think so.</td>', 'Creative, but not meeting the challenge for me I''m afraid. I might go for it if there was actually a brown ribbon but little gold people..hmm, I don''t think so.', '2009-08-22 07:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5619953, 813908, 101117, '<td valign="top">I''ve often thought it would be nice to wake up to a blue ribbon, though perhaps not in this sense.<br/> <br/>Nice shot, but it kinda feels like the whole lot is hovering, particularly the cereal box. I think given the ''breakfast table'' type idea, it might have been nice to actually have a visible surface.</td>', 'I''ve often thought it would be nice to wake up to a blue ribbon, though perhaps not in this sense. Nice shot, but it kinda feels like the whole lot is hovering, particularly the cereal box. I think given the ''breakfast table'' type idea, it might have been nice to actually have a visible surface.', '2009-08-22 07:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
