(5621312, 814466, 83313, '<td valign="top">I love the sarcasm here, but I am not sure if I need to give you a good vote for the humor, or a 1 to help with the brownie you may be trying for. Problem I have found it that if you really want the brown, you have to avoid making a statement that people will appreciate. They will give you good votes for that.<br/> <br/>Wouldn''t it be funny if a dozen people clicked the "rules violation" button on this one for preexisting artwork? No, I didn''t think it would be.<br/> <br/>Added:<br/>Why am a certain this is from a someone recently DQ''d under the existing artwork rule?<br/> <br/>Giving this a late bump up, because I really like the humor in it, as well as one of my arguably coveted shoehorn awards for the humor.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=737193" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/83313/120/737193.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/83313/120/737193.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/83313/120/737193.jpg"/></a></td>', 'I love the sarcasm here, but I am not sure if I need to give you a good vote for the humor, or a 1 to help with the brownie you may be trying for. Problem I have found it that if you really want the brown, you have to avoid making a statement that people will appreciate. They will give you good votes for that. Wouldn''t it be funny if a dozen people clicked the "rules violation" button on this one for preexisting artwork? No, I didn''t think it would be. Added:Why am a certain this is from a someone recently DQ''d under the existing artwork rule? Giving this a late bump up, because I really like the humor in it, as well as one of my arguably coveted shoehorn awards for the humor.', '2009-08-23 22:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5621314, 813908, 83313, '<td valign="top">I expect to see this on the front page, and probably with it''s own ribbon. You put a lot of work and thought into this. I love all the little touch of Seymour on the milk carton.<br/> <br/>I want to see the other 3 in the series!<br/> <br/>Added:<br/>The missing duck ad on the milk carton is what put this over the top for me.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=737192" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/83313/120/737192.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/83313/120/737192.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/83313/120/737192.jpg"/></a></td>', 'I expect to see this on the front page, and probably with it''s own ribbon. You put a lot of work and thought into this. I love all the little touch of Seymour on the milk carton. I want to see the other 3 in the series! Added:The missing duck ad on the milk carton is what put this over the top for me.', '2009-08-23 22:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5621315, 814278, 83313, '<td valign="top">You are getting as bad with entering Clark as I am with the shoehorns! I have to admire the cajones! (Not voting yet, I just had to leave a comment on this one!)<br/> <br/>Speaking of which, it''s been a while since I''ve done a shoehorn shot....<br/> <br/>Added: Ok, I voted. Extra pointage for being persistent. You''re building a nice collection of Clark shots.<br/> <br/>More added:<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=737194" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/83313/120/737194.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/83313/120/737194.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/83313/120/737194.jpg"/></a> <br/>Usually I give my shoehorn for humor, but I think your persistence and creativity in shoehorning Clark into a challenge every week is worthy of some recognition. Might be dubious recognition, but it''s something, right?</td>', 'You are getting as bad with entering Clark as I am with the shoehorns! I have to admire the cajones! (Not voting yet, I just had to leave a comment on this one!) Speaking of which, it''s been a while since I''ve done a shoehorn shot.... Added: Ok, I voted. Extra pointage for being persistent. You''re building a nice collection of Clark shots. More added: Usually I give my shoehorn for humor, but I think your persistence and creativity in shoehorning Clark into a challenge every week is worthy of some recognition. Might be dubious recognition, but it''s something, right?', '2009-08-23 22:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
