(5621493, 814244, 65319, '<td valign="top">You know, I stared at this image for a while and was completely baffled.  I didn''t vote on this image because I''m so dumb...I just didn''t know what to do with it.  I feel now I should have taken the <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=50695" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Posthumous</a> approach and given it a 10 for mysteriousness.  ;-)</td>', 'You know, I stared at this image for a while and was completely baffled.  I didn''t vote on this image because I''m so dumb...I just didn''t know what to do with it.  I feel now I should have taken the  Posthumous approach and given it a 10 for mysteriousness.  ;-)', '2009-08-24 01:16:21.000000', NULL, 0),
