(5621561, 814067, 23002, '<td valign="top">Now the mystery of why there is grey around the edges of the drops has been solved.  Thanks for showing your set up.  Because the white paper was not lit in any way it turned to grey when you exposed for the self-illuminated iphone picture. :)<br/> <br/>Good job Andrew.  I think that thanks to me not entering we will likely lose the FDPC.  Sorry about that.  I am certainly willing to give it another go if you are when the second one is announced. :)</td>', 'Now the mystery of why there is grey around the edges of the drops has been solved.  Thanks for showing your set up.  Because the white paper was not lit in any way it turned to grey when you exposed for the self-illuminated iphone picture. :) Good job Andrew.  I think that thanks to me not entering we will likely lose the FDPC.  Sorry about that.  I am certainly willing to give it another go if you are when the second one is announced. :)', '2009-08-24 01:53:46.000000', NULL, 0),
